---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | StayJustin"
  description="Read the StayJustin privacy policy."
  canonical="https://www.stayjustin.com/privacy-policy/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container intro-block">
      <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="intro-copy">
        StayJustin may collect basic information you choose to provide, such as when you contact the site or subscribe to the newsletter.
      </p>
      <p class="intro-copy">
        This site may also use standard analytics, hosting, or newsletter tools that collect basic usage information such as page visits,
        browser type, or referring links.
      </p>
      <p class="intro-copy">
        Personal information is not sold. If you contact the site directly, your message and contact information may be kept in order to respond.
      </p>
      <p class="intro-copy">
        Newsletter subscriptions are managed through the newsletter provider you use to subscribe. Please review that provider’s policies
        for more information about how subscription data is handled.
      </p>
      <p class="intro-copy">
        If you have questions about this policy, contact:
        <a href="mailto:Justin@StayJustin.com">Justin@StayJustin.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
